          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising defense-oriented funding and grants earmarked for the conflict expands budgets for robustness, red-teaming, and verification of AI systems as militaries and contractors allocate resources to ensure battlefield reliability and avoid catastrophic failures." />
