          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Surges in Western defense aid to Ukraine drive redeployment and longer forward-stationing of US/NATO naval and air assets to Europe, reducing patrols and real-time deterrence in the Red Sea/Gulf and thereby enabling more Houthi interdiction of shipping." />
