          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Larger and more visible arms deliveries to one side prompt retaliatory rhetoric, countermeasures and security posturing by opposing states, directly raising international political and security tensions that affect energy risk perceptions." />
