          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Greater policy coordination among external allies increases market expectations of sustained coordinated restrictions or supply re-routing (and a higher risk premium), which raises diesel price levels even before additional physical supply changes occur." />
