          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter export controls (notably on dual‑use components) prompt alternative, covert transfers by actors seeking to evade sanctions—accelerating deliveries of drone/missile components to Iran and its Houthi proxies and enabling more frequent/higher‑capability strikes." />
          <attvalue for="37" value="6-18 months" />
