          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A higher systemic likelihood of reciprocal escalation leads states and proxies to undertake more offensive cyber and influence operations, increasing attempts to breach, tamper with, or exfiltrate AI models and data." />
