          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A higher likelihood that Middle Eastern incidents will broaden forces allied states to prioritize divergent regional responses (naval escorts, diplomatic outreach, bilateral deals), producing timing and policy disagreements that erode unity and coordinated policy toward the Russia‑Ukraine conflict." />
