          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher volumes and reliability of cross-border shipments reduce transit bottlenecks and delays for physical delivery of weapons and munitions into and around the conflict zone, increasing the rate and volume of transfers." />
