          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising geopolitical tensions raise incentives for state and proxy actors to conduct cyber‑operations and supply‑chain attacks targeting AI infrastructure for espionage, disruption or coercion, directly increasing the frequency of security incidents against AI systems and platforms." />
